# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MultiBatch replication package -- what must never be published
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The rule this file follows: the repository ships exactly what the manuscript,
# the Online Resources and the pipeline in run_all.py need.  Everything else --
# the submission package, the internal audit notes, the scratch directories and
# the analyses that did not make it into the paper -- stays local.
#
# If you are about to `git add -A`, read this list first: it is what keeps a
# cover letter, a strategy note or a local username out of a public history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- data: never redistributed (see README, Data Availability) ---
data/

# --- manuscript sources and submission packages (submission-only) ---
manuscript.tex
manuscript.pdf
manuscript.bbl
manuscript.blg
cover_letter.tex
cover_letter.pdf
supplementary_figures.pdf
VALUE_STATEMENT.md
MultiBatch_Replication.zip
MultiBatch_LaTeX_Source.zip
MultiBatch_*.zip
FIG_Upload/
GNG_Upload/
GenesGenomics_Scope_Check/
_zip_verify/

# --- internal audit notes and reviews (working documents, not package files) ---
GITHUB_REPO_AUDIT.md
FIGURE_AUDIT.md
FNG_GUIDELINE_COMPLIANCE.md
FNG_SUBMISSION_CHECKLIST.md
REFERENCE_AUDIT_vs_MODEL_PAPER.md
REVIEW_FINAL_WORD_AUDIT.md
REVIEW_LOGIC_COHERENCE_READABILITY.md

# --- scratch, archives, tooling caches ---
_archive/
_scratch/
_rep_check/
_zipcheck/
.playwright-cli/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- LaTeX build products ---
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz

# --- backups ---
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.prev
*_old.*

# --- root-level probe scripts and logs ---
/_*.txt
/_*.py

# --- result caches that are rebuilt rather than shipped ---
# 46 MB expression cache; _prep_fig1_landscape.py rebuilds it from the TCGA files
results/_fig1_landscape.npz

# --- figures superseded by the current numbering ---
# Fig 2-5 of the pre-submission set; the manuscript now uses Fig1-Fig9
figures/fig2_tcga.*
figures/fig3_baselines.*
figures/fig5_biological_validation.*
# the 11 single-gene Kaplan-Meier panels superseded by Figure 5, listed by name
# on purpose: a wildcard is unsafe here, because core.ignorecase makes the
# character class match lowercase too and would swallow km_brca_panel as well
figures/km_ADH1B.png
figures/km_ADIPOQ.png
figures/km_CEACAM5.png
figures/km_COL17A1.png
figures/km_CST1.png
figures/km_KLK6.png
figures/km_KRT5.png
figures/km_NAT1.png
figures/km_NKAIN1.png
figures/km_SCGB2A2.png
figures/km_TFF1.png

# --- analyses that are not part of the manuscript or the Online Resources ---
